</TD>
    <TD></TD>
    <TD valign="bottom">
<DIV style="text-indent: -9pt; margin-left: 9pt">
    &#149;&#160;<I>Experienced Management Team</I>&#160;&#151;
    NorthStar has a highly experienced management team of real
