<TR>
    <TD valign="top">
    <B>Q: </B></TD>
    <TD></TD>
    <TD valign="bottom">
    <B>Why should I invest specifically in a company that is focused
    on commercial real estate loans and commercial real-estate
    related debt securities?</B></TD>
