    economic conditions may also impact the market for our
    investments and the volatility of our investments. The returns
    available to investors in our targeted investments are
    determined, in part, by: (i)&#160;the supply and demand for such
    investments and (ii)&#160;the existence of a market for such
    investments, which includes the ability to sell or finance such
    investments. During periods of volatility, the number of
    investors participating in the market may change at an
    accelerated pace. If either demand or liquidity increases, the
