    will have little exposure to loss in the value of our shares.
    Without this exposure, our investors may be at a greater risk of
    loss because NorthStar does not have as much to lose from a
    decrease in the value of our shares as do those sponsors who
    make more significant equity investments in their companies.
</DIV>

