    such interests, we are subject to risks of borrower defaults,
    bankruptcies, fraud, losses and special hazard losses that are
    not covered by standard hazard insurance. In the event of any
    default under loans, we bear the risk of loss of principal and
    nonpayment of interest and fees to the extent of any deficiency
    between the value of the collateral and the principal amount of
    the loan. To the extent we suffer such losses with respect to
