    markets in the U.S.&#160;have virtually closed. We believe that
    the credit market disruption will continue over the near term
    and will create opportunities to purchase targeted assets at
    discounted levels as risk management and liquidity issues begin
    to dictate portfolio decision making. We believe that these
    market factors will allow us to selectively purchase assets from
    third party sellers at favorable risk-adjusted returns and at an
    appropriate cost basis. As competition decreases from
    participants who are purely capital markets oriented, do not
    have strong credit track records
    <FONT style="white-space: nowrap">and/or</FONT> have
    liquidity constraints, the scarcity of debt capital will also
    create opportunities for our company to directly originate and
    to co-originate investments at pricing levels that provide for
    attractive returns, in many cases utilizing little or no
