    REIT commencing with our taxable year ending December 31 of the
    year in which we satisfy the minimum offering requirements. To
    maintain our qualification as a REIT, we will be required to
    make aggregate annual distributions to our stockholders of at
    least 90% of our REIT taxable income (computed without regard to
